## 待审文本（按字段）
{
 "reply": "Hi Kevin,\n\nThank you for your inquiry about our Portable Blender Cup (model BL-35P). An Amazon US launch needs the right compliance documents, so I'll start with certification and material status.\n\n1. FCC\nThis model does not have an FCC SDoC test report at the moment. Our current documents are CE (EMC) and the UN38.3 battery test report. If FCC is required for your listing, one option is to order samples and have them tested at a lab you nominate. If you would like us to look into testing on our side, please let me know and I will come back to you with the details. Testing time and cost would need to be agreed before the order is confirmed.\n\n2. BPA free\nThe cup body is made of Tritan. Our material supplier has issued a BPA-free declaration, and I can share it with you. However, we do not have a third-party test report on the finished product. If you need one for Amazon, the samples can also be tested by your lab.\n\n3. Price\nFor 2,000 pcs, our price is USD 6.20/pc FOB Ningbo. For 5,000 pcs and above, it is USD 5.70/pc. I understand your target is USD 5.20, but we are not able to reach that level, even at higher volumes.\n\n4. Lead time\nOur lead time is 35 days after deposit and artwork confirmation, so we cannot ship within 25 days. If your launch date is fixed, we suggest placing the order as early as possible.\n\n5. Logo and packaging\nWe can print your logo on the color box free of charge, since the order is over 1,000 pcs. Please send your logo as a vector file (AI/PDF/EPS). Packing is 40 pcs per carton.\n\nOther details:\n- Capacity: 350 ml\n- Battery: 2,000 mAh, USB-C charging\n- Blades: 6 stainless steel blades\n- Operation: one button, with auto power-off when the cup is detached\n- Battery life: about 12 blends per charge (our factory test)\n- Payment: 30% T/T deposit and 70% against B/L copy, or L/C at sight\n- MOQ: 1,000 pcs\n\nNext steps:\n- Samples: charged at the unit price. International freight is paid by the buyer, and the sample cost can be deducted from your bulk order.\n- Video factory audit: we can arrange one through an Alibaba video call if you'd like to see our production line.\n\nCould you let me know whether you would like to arrange FCC testing and whether the 35-day lead time works for your schedule? I'm happy to prepare a formal PI once these points are clear.\n\nBest regards,\nSales Team\nYongjiang Small Appliances"
}
